==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Inflation: Uber Rare}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Mini White Cyclone]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 10,000 seconds<sup>300,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The biggest issues are the Mini White Cyclones, so bring [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] for anti-Floating CC and some anti-Floating and Relic damage dealers such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] or [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]]. Do not continuously spam CC units unless there is a cyclone, otherwise there may not be enough money to finish the round.

==Trivia==
*The [[Othom]] that spawns after 10,000 seconds (300,000 frames or exactly 2 hours, 46 minutes, and 40 seconds) in this stage has the record for longest spawn time in the game.

